protocolhandler-mailto-os-handler-yes-button = 设置其为默认项
protocolhandler-mailto-os-handler-no-button = 现在不设置

## Variables:
##  $url (String): The url of a webmailer, but only its full domain name.

protocolhandler-mailto-handler-set = 是否使用<strong>{ -brand-short-name }来启动 { $url }</strong>，以便您每次单击打开电子邮件的链接时使用？
protocolhandler-mailto-handler-confirm = <strong>{ -brand-short-name }将启动 { $url }</strong>，以便您每次单击发送电子邮件的链接时使用。

